<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/18/eng@/~cl_48__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Any investigation or proceedings commenced or pending before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall, after the date of coming into operation of this Act, be continued as if the principal Act has not been amended by this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/18/eng@> .
